{"reviews":[{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-0","r":5.0,"t":"Favorite way to scrub my back","x":"This brush is great for reaching your back for a good scrub! The bristles are soft and do a great job of exfoliating. The handle is curved ergonomically. The loop makes it easy to hang.","h":154,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-1","r":5.0,"t":"Suitable length!Comfortable brush!","x":"The length is really 36cm and about 14inch. This length is long enough and it's best length. This is my second brush bought on Amazon.No one can be better than this one.Firstly,the design is fine and comfortable,you will not feel short and too slip.The most important is the length is very fine. Before buying this product, I found some people said the length is short. I have to say it's perfect length.Trust me!Buy it!","h":150,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-2","r":5.0,"t":"The perfect body brush","x":"I love this body brush!  The bristles are perfect. I've had problems with the bristles falling out of other brushes, not with this one. Also like the lightweight handle.","h":131,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-3","r":5.0,"t":"Just right!","x":"This is my third Body Brush after buying two others on Amazon with bristles from hell. This is perfect! It's soft and good quality.","h":121,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-4","r":5.0,"t":"The best brush I have ever used!","x":"Trush me!It's the best brush I have ever used. SOFT and Comfortable brush can make you feel so good and clean.","h":105,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-5","r":5.0,"t":"soft strudy bristles","x":"I really like this.  I'm over 6ft tall and the handle is long enough to reach my back.  The bristles are very sturdy but yet soft.  I can even use this on my feet.  It is definitely a decent price.","h":73,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-6","r":5.0,"t":"Softest bristles ...perfect reach.","x":"Softest bristles of any body brush I\u2019ve bought!  Reaches entire back perfectly.  Only wish the head was twice as big..  will buy again as present.","h":72,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-7","r":5.0,"t":"Best back brush for the shower","x":"I have purchased so many brushes and for the past 2 years could not find a soft but firm bristle to use in the shower. Just like Goldilocks this brush is JUST RIGHT.  The handle isn't too long, the bristles are soft enough so they don't rip my skin. I just ordered a back up in case I can't find this again. For me...this is the perfect brush.","h":57,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-8","r":5.0,"t":"Not easy to maneuver.","x":"Could be a little longer for people with no length in arm. Softness good. Not easy to maneuver.","h":47,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-9","r":5.0,"t":"Great product!","x":"This is exactly what I needed; perfect length and really gets a nice deep clean.","h":46,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-10","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent brush forvthr money!","x":"Great brush! Easy to hold, scrubs up good without using a ton of soap, and it dries quickly.","h":41,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-11","r":2.0,"t":"Very Disappointed","x":"Not what I expected.  The head of the brush is much smaller than the picture.  Bristles are too soft.  Over priced!","h":31,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-12","r":1.0,"t":"Too short.","x":"Way too short to be of any use. Straight in the trash it went.","h":28,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-13","r":5.0,"t":"Wonderfully soft and designed to get you clean","x":"A great wonderfully soft bath brush designed to get every part of your body clean. I like it so much I'm ordering another one.","h":22,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-14","r":5.0,"t":"Soft and great quality","x":"I replaced my older sponge one with this brush and i feel like i m not wasting as much body wash with using the brush as it gets foamy alot faster and get it to be rinsed out faster and cleaner too.  It gets completely dry quickly as i was a bit worry about molding since they are so dense, but it really dries up fast.  I point it downward when trying it thou","h":20,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-15","r":4.0,"t":"Great bristles!","x":"The bristles are perfect not too soft not too firm. I would pay a couple of bucks more if it had a rubber handle for better gripping. The length of it is perfect for me because I am only 5 ft tall.","h":20,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-16","r":5.0,"t":"After shopping a ridiculous amount of time for a shower brush...","x":"I found these and loved the minimalist elegant design and muted colors.  The matte finish is easy to keep a grip on, the brush is neither too soft or too scratchy for my taste, and the reach is good.  This one's a keeper.","h":16,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-17","r":5.0,"t":"Better than expected","x":"This back brush is perfect in every way--just the right combination of softness and scrubbing strength. Very glad to have it.","h":15,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-18","r":5.0,"t":"Back brush","x":"Very pleased with this new back brush. Soft yet firm bristles.Comfortable and easy to grip in shower.Feels nice on my skin not to soft or to stiff .At first I thought the bristle head was small compared to my old brush .It works great between shoulder blades and middle of back. I reach anywhere  and not feel I will lose my grip.The handle has just enough arch for nice pressure control for a good scrub.","h":14,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-19","r":4.0,"t":"Dose a great job I like it","x":"I like this brush because it\u2019s brissels are seemingly soft but it still removes any dry flaky skin, And it is a comfortable length, only negative is the Brussel head could be larger, maybe 3/4\u201d but then some people might find that to big. So all in all it is a good brush for the money","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-20","r":1.0,"t":"nice quality but...","x":"Did I get a bad one or what? The description says \"NON SLIP HANDLE\" but it is NOT. I cannot hold on to it without it sliding around in my hand. I have no choice but to return it and look for something with a less slippery handle.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-21","r":5.0,"t":"A Back Scrubber that Reaches the Whole Back!","x":"Finally, a back scrubber that reaches far enough down the back, is easy to hold on to and the bristles are stiff enough to scrub and soft enough to feel good. Will definitely buy again.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-22","r":1.0,"t":"Definitely a brush for a petite person.","x":"This is probably the worst purchase I have made on Amazon. Not the right brush for a 6'2\" man. It is much smaller than I expected. The overall length is 14\" . The brush is 3 x2.5. I will be returning.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-23","r":1.0,"t":"Too small tone effective","x":"I bought this for a shower backbrush. It\u2019s too small to use effectively but works well for scrubbing my feet.  It arrived with a deep crease longways down the brush, presumably from being squeezed in storage or transit.  The crease has come out enough to use the brush but it\u2019s still there after 6 months.  If a larger size were available I would buy it, but this size is more suitable for a child.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07KXVGHTV-24","r":4.0,"t":"So far, so good...","x":"I really like this brush.  I would give it 5 stars if the handle was just a bit longer.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the bristles as soft yet effective for exfoliating and cleaning.","cites":[1,4,5,6,7,8,10,14,15]},{"text":"Many customers find the handle length well-suited for reaching the back, though a few say it is too short.","cites":[2,6,7,8,10,13]},{"text":"Several reviewers highlight the brush's quality and value, noting durable bristles and a reasonable price.","cites":[3,4,6,11,15]},{"text":"A few customers complain the brush head is smaller than expected or that the bristles are too soft.","cites":[7,12]},{"text":"Some reviewers mention the brush dries quickly and lathers well, helping conserve body wash.","cites":[11,15]}]},"qa":[]}